msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Kitamura「Last night, I was too excited to realize＿it, but......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Anoche estaba tan emocionado＿que no lo noté, pero......」"

msgid "Kitamura「By the way, I managed to think of a＿reason for your rejection...... but that's＿not what I wanted to talk about.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Por cierto, se me ocurrió una＿razón para tu rechazo...... Pero＿no quería hablar de eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Kitamura「Look, Takasu...... Do you understand＿why I wanted to meet with you?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Mira, Takasu...... ¿Entiendes＿por qué quería verte?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Listen up,\" is that it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Escucha bien\", es eso?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Yes, precisely, Takasu. Over the phone,＿when I told you Kushi...... I mean, the＿softball team's schedule......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Exacto, Takasu. Cuando te dije por＿teléfono el horario de Kushi...... digo,＿del equipo de sóftbol......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Today, you were in the middle of＿deciding that you needed to do＿something, am I correct?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Hoy estabas decidiendo que tenías＿que hacer algo, ¿me equivoco?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Yeah. I didn't talk to you about it,＿but I'm actually pretty committed to it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Sí. No te lo conté, pero＿la verdad estoy muy decidido.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Wait a minute...... Now I see what's＿going on.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Un momento...... Ahora＿entiendo lo que pasa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What do you mean?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿A qué te refieres?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Damn, how much of my mind can＿you read?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Rayos, ¿hasta dónde＿puedes leerme la mente?」"

msgid "Kitamura「This \"God of Heartbreak\" title isn't just＿for show. Hahaha......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No me llaman \"Dios del Desamor\"＿por nada. Jajaja......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Now then. It's time to discuss the main＿issue that I wanted to bring to your＿attention......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Bueno, es hora de hablar del asunto＿principal que quería mencionarte......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Takasu, you're serious, and sincere as＿fuck. So I conclude that you might be＿obsessed with your past feelings.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Takasu, eres serio y muy sincero. Por＿eso creo que podrías estar obsesionado＿con lo que sentías antes.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Pfft.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Pfft.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Hmm? This is no laughing matter......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Hmm? Esto no es para reírse......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I appreciate any suggestions from＿the God of Heartbreak. I'm all ears.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, agradezco los consejos del Dios＿del Desamor. Soy todo oídos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well...... I guess, when I opened my eyes＿this morning, it all became clear to me＿and stuff......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno...... Supongo que al＿despertar esta mañana lo vi＿todo claro y eso......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait, what are you making me say!? It's＿too embarrassing to talk about!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espera, ¡¿qué me haces decir?! ¡Me＿da mucha vergüenza hablar de eso!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Oh, calm down, Takasu...... Hmm, I feel＿somewhat relieved.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ah, cálmate, Takasu...... Hmm,＿me siento algo aliviado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「As expected, you're overthinking it......＿Eh, well, it might have occurred to me＿that this is a good opportunity.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Como esperaba, le das demasiadas＿vueltas...... Eh, bueno, quizá pensé＿que era una buena oportunidad.」"

msgid "Kitamura「That's good then...... Well then, allow me＿to add to the unsolicited, unnecessary＿comments.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Entonces está bien...... Permíteme＿añadir unos comentarios innecesarios＿que nadie pidió.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Kitamura「Have I conveyed precisely what I＿wanted to?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Expresé con precisión lo que quería?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Probably.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Good...... Based on that, I'm going to ask＿this, hypocrite that I am.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Bien...... Sabiendo eso, te preguntaré＿esto, hipócrita que soy.」"

msgid "Please answer my prayers"
msgstr "Por favor, escucha mis plegarias"

msgid "Please let me forget"
msgstr "Por favor, déjame olvidar"

msgid "Just hit me"
msgstr "Solo golpéame"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well...... I mean, will you answer my＿prayers?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno...... O sea, ¿escucharás＿mis plegarias?」"

msgid "Kitamura「......I see. Alright, you got it.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......Ya veo. Bien, cuenta conmigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait. Don't you think you're＿contradicting what you said earlier?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espera. ¿No crees que contradices＿lo que dijiste antes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I'm not sure I could be as＿straightforward as you about＿embarrassing stuff.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No sé si podría hablar＿de cosas vergonzosas con tanta＿franqueza como tú.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But talking like that...... Oh, forget it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero hablar así...... Ah, olvídalo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Haha...... Alright, as promised, I'll give＿you a revelation just this once.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Jajaja...... Bien, como prometí, te daré＿una revelación solo por esta vez.」"

msgid "Kitamura「It's okay! Believe and it will happen! Go＿forth without hesitation! So--」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Está bien! ¡Cree y se cumplirá!＿¡Avanza sin dudar! Así que--」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hold it! Not here! That's enough......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Espera! ¡Aquí no! Basta ya......」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Oh, you're right! The dignity of every＿Oohashi student will get called into＿question. How rude of me. Hahaha!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¡Ah, tienes razón! Quedaría＿en duda la dignidad de todos en Oohashi.＿Qué grosero. ¡Jajaja!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And you're the student council＿president, for that matter.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y eres el presidente del consejo＿estudiantil, además.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Mm, indeed. But still, take it easy. You＿and Ai-- I mean, your prayers have＿been heard.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Mmm, cierto. Aun así, tranquilo.＿Tú y Ai-- digo, tus plegarias＿han sido escuchadas.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Hopefully, they really will be granted.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Espero que de verdad se cumplan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's not something a god should say.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso no debería decirlo un dios.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Haha, well, isn't that convenient......＿Still, thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Jajaja, bueno, qué conveniente......＿Aun así, gracias.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kitamura......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Don't be afraid of the outcome! I don't＿want you to have any regrets!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡No temas el resultado! ¡No＿quiero que te arrepientas!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura...... I told you to keep your＿voice down.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kitamura...... Te dije＿que bajaras la voz.」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Oh, shit!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¡Ah, mierda!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I'd prefer if you let me forget.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Preferiría que me dejaras olvidar.」"

msgid "Kitamura「............」"
msgstr "Kitamura「............」"

msgid "Kitamura「I...... I think you're wrong, Takasu.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Yo...... Creo que te equivocas, Takasu.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Really?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿En serio?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Yeah. In any case, I think that attitude＿goes against reason. You can't change＿the past, after all.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Sí. En todo caso, esa actitud me＿parece ilógica. Al fin y al cabo,＿no puedes cambiar el pasado.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What about them......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y los demás......?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Every time she meets you, every time＿you happen to cross her mind, it's a＿fact she is forced to accept.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Cada vez que te ve o que piensa＿en ti, es un hecho que se ve＿obligada a aceptar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Kitamura「That's why I think you have to＿remember it, accept it, and overcome＿it.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Por eso creo que tienes que recordarlo,＿aceptarlo y superarlo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Yeah, it's a completely sound＿argument.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Sí, es un argumento＿completamente válido.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Takasu, I think you need to prepare＿your heart first.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Takasu, creo que primero debes＿preparar tu corazón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............Yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............Sí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, I'd rather you just hit me, please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, prefiero que me golpees, por favor.」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Well, according to what I said＿warranted a punch from me, you don't＿qualify.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......Bueno, según lo que dije＿que merecía un golpe de mi parte,＿tú no lo mereces.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "\"Crush it to pieces and, hmmm,＿sprinkle them in a river, perhaps?\""
msgstr "\"Hazlo pedazos y, hmmm, ¿por qué no los＿esparces en un río?\""

msgid "\"Get going, you lazy dog!\""
msgstr "\"¡Muévete, perro flojo!\""

msgid "\"Taiga probably really regrets it, after＿all.\""
msgstr "\"Después de todo, seguro que Taiga lo＿lamenta mucho.\""

msgid "\"Listen, Takasu-kun. Taiga really＿regrets what happened.\""
msgstr "\"Escucha, Takasu-kun. Taiga lamenta＿mucho lo que pasó.\""

msgid "\"I guess it's not possible to prepare for＿something you don't even remember.＿But I remember, so I need to.\""
msgstr "\"Supongo que no puedes prepararte para＿algo que ni recuerdas. Pero yo sí lo＿recuerdo, así que debo hacerlo.\""

msgid "\"If...... if you never remember, it'll be like＿it never happened, Takasu-kun.\""
msgstr "\"Si...... si nunca lo recuerdas, será＿como si nunca hubiera pasado,＿Takasu-kun.\""

msgid "\"She overlooks her own feelings and＿feigns ignorance. Arrrgh, she really＿grinds my gears, you know.\""
msgstr "\"Ignora sus propios sentimientos y se＿hace la que no sabe. Argh, de verdad que＿me saca de quicio.\""

msgid "Kitamura「......It would seem I was right.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......Parece que tenía razón.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Take your time and start from the＿beginning.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Tómate tu tiempo y empieza＿por el principio.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's why you should hit me for＿saying all this. If you don't, I won't get it＿through my head and stuff......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Por eso debes golpearme por decir＿todo esto. Si no lo haces, no me entrará＿en la cabeza y eso......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Alright. You've conveyed your feelings＿most precisely.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Bien. Expresaste tus sentimientos＿con total precisión.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey Kitamura...... I've gone and made＿this pretty inconvenient with my＿selfishness, huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, Kitamura...... He complicado＿todo con mi egoísmo, ¿no?」"

msgid "Kitamura「I don't think so. I think that's just proof＿of your sincerity in your own way......＿Alright, let's head out.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No lo creo. Eso demuestra tu sinceridad,＿a tu manera...... Bien, salgamos.」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Are you prepared?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¿Estás preparado?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No need to go easy on me, please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No te contengas, por favor.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Alright...... Then grit your teeth!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Bien...... ¡Entonces aprieta＿los dientes!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Owwww...... You really didn't go easy on＿me......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ayyyy...... De verdad que＿no te contuviste......」"

msgid "Kitamura「That's my sincerity.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Esa es mi sinceridad.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... gracias.」"

msgid "Kitamura「And on top of all that, you stay positive＿and try to make progress on your own＿two feet.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Y encima de todo, sigues siendo＿positivo e intentas avanzar por＿tus propios medios.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're exaggerating.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Exageras.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Don't be afraid of the outcome! When＿it's all over, I'll happily let you punch＿me! Now go! Run! Takasu Ryuuji!!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡No temas el resultado! ¡Al acabar,＿me dejaré golpear con gusto! ¡Ve!＿¡Corre! ¡Takasu Ryuuji!!」"

msgid "Kitamura「After a while I thought it over calmly,＿and then in light of recent＿developments surrounding you, the」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Luego lo pensé con calma y, a la luz de＿lo que te ha pasado últimamente, el」"

msgid "Kitamura「current state of things finally dawned＿on me.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「estado actual de las cosas＿por fin me quedó claro.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Well, that was just my introduction, so＿pay it no mind. Like how the Power＿Rangers must decide on their poses」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Bueno, era solo mi introducción,＿ignórala. Como los Power Rangers,＿que eligen sus poses」"

msgid "Kitamura「before they battle the enemy.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「antes de luchar contra el enemigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Last night, Haruta may have been＿listening in while in that predicament,＿but even still, in that state I doubt he」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Anoche quizá Haruta nos escuchaba,＿aun en esa situación, pero dudo que＿en ese estado」"

msgid "Ryuuji「understood even half of it...... And it's＿getting complicated.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「entendiera ni la mitad......＿Y se está complicando.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Basically, you're committed to Aisaka＿and Kushieda's situation. Now you're＿the only one who can take action to」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Básicamente, estás decidido a resolver＿lo de Aisaka y Kushieda. Solo tú puedes＿actuar ahora para」"

msgid "Kitamura「overcome the circumstances......＿Correct?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「superar la situación...... ¿Cierto?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Just hear me all the way out...... So, you＿said last night that your feelings＿haven't caught up, right? If so, those」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Escúchame hasta el final...... Anoche＿dijiste que tus sentimientos seguían＿rezagados, ¿no? Si es así, esas」"

msgid "Kitamura「emotions are already in the past.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「emociones ya quedaron en el pasado.」"

msgid "Kitamura「That's why I believe that trying to get＿them back at this point is impossible.＿What's important is how you feel right」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Por eso creo que ya es imposible＿recuperarlas. Lo importante es lo que＿sientes justo」"

msgid "Kitamura「now.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「ahora.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, my bad. Truth is, Kawashima＿told me the exact same thing. It's＿funny to see just how similar your」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Perdón, fue mi culpa. La verdad,＿Kawashima me dijo lo mismo. Me da risa＿ver lo parecidas que son sus」"

msgid "Ryuuji「thought processes are.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「formas de pensar.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Oh, really now...... Man, I was thinking＿for just a moment that I was imparting＿something meaningful, but for you it's」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ah, ¿en serio......? Vaya, por un＿momento creí que decía algo importante,＿pero para ti es」"

msgid "Kitamura「like a re-run.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「como una repetición.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Haha! Alright then...... Well? Is your＿heart full of feelings for someone right＿now? Mind, I won't ask who that」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Jajaja! Bien...... ¿Y? ¿Tu corazón＿rebosa amor por alguien ahora? No＿preguntaré quién es ese」"

msgid "Kitamura「someone is, so please answer.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「alguien, así que responde, por favor.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Knowing you, it's conceivable you'd＿rather confess your feelings than＿stand by and watch the girls hurt each」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Conociéndote, quizá prefieras confesar＿lo que sientes antes que ver a las＿chicas herirse unas」"

msgid "Kitamura「other, I think.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「a otras, creo yo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Takasu, knowing you this would never＿happen, but if you were to rebound＿onto one after being rejected by the」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Takasu, sé que tú nunca lo harías,＿pero si recurrieras a una por despecho＿tras el rechazo de la」"

msgid "Kitamura「other, I'd have to punch you.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「otra, tendría que golpearte.」"

msgid "Kitamura「On the other hand, if you were to say \"I＿already know how things will work out＿with her,\" I'd have to punch you for」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Por otro lado, si dijeras \"Ya sé＿cómo me irá con ella\", también＿tendría que golpearte por」"

msgid "Kitamura「that too. You'd be lying to yourself.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「eso. Te estarías mintiendo a ti mismo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「The other day, a certain person......＿Well, I'm sure you can figure out who.＿They told me you pray that you'll be」"
msgstr "Kitamura「El otro día, cierta persona......＿Bueno, seguro sabes quién. Me＿dijo que rezas para」"

msgid "Kitamura「able to regain your former passion.＿What say you?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「poder recuperar tu antigua＿pasión. ¿Qué dices?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Maybe I am. I don't think so. After all,＿Takasu, you really are sincere. No＿matter what you do, your former......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Quizá sí. No lo creo. Después de todo,＿Takasu, eres muy sincero. Hagas lo que＿hagas, tus antiguos......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Argh, I'm gonna just go ahead and say＿it.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Argh, lo diré de una vez.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Either way, I think it goes against＿reason not to try and remember the＿feelings you once had for Kushieda」"
msgstr "Kitamura「En fin, creo que es ilógico no intentar＿recordar lo que sentías por Kushieda」"

msgid "Kitamura「and and the pain of heartbreak......＿Well? Am I wrong?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「y el dolor del desamor......＿Bueno, ¿me equivoco?」"

msgid "Kitamura「I can understand feeling awkward, but＿it's nothing to be ashamed of. The＿Takasu Ryuuji I know is just that」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Entiendo que te incomode, pero no＿es vergonzoso. El Takasu Ryuuji que＿conozco es así de」"

msgid "Kitamura「sincere.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「sincero.」"

msgid "Kitamura「The one who said that just now wasn't＿the God of Heartbreak. It was Takasu＿Ryuuji's best friend Kitamura Yuusaku,」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Eso no lo dijo el Dios del Desamor,＿sino Kitamura Yuusaku, el mejor amigo＿de Takasu Ryuuji,」"

msgid "Kitamura「so it's fine.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「así que está bien.」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Alright, I will undertake your former＿wounds. That pain has surely been＿reborn in my heart. So it's okay! Don't」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......Bien, asumiré tus viejas heridas.＿Ese dolor ha renacido en mi corazón.＿¡Así que está bien! ¡No」"

msgid "Kitamura「hesitate to go settle things!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「dudes en ir a resolver las cosas!」"

msgid "Kitamura「I suggest talking to Aisaka, since she＿questioned Kushieda's true intentions,＿so she might have had a change of」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Sugiero hablar con Aisaka, pues dudó＿de las verdaderas intenciones de＿Kushieda y quizá haya cambiado de」"

msgid "Kitamura「heart.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「opinión.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Even if I did remember, by this point......＿Isn't it better not to remember the＿pain of rejection? Losing my nerve」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Aunque lo recordara ahora...... ¿No es＿mejor no recordar el dolor del rechazo?＿Perder el valor」"

msgid "Ryuuji「wouldn't help anything.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「no ayudaría en nada.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Takasu...... Even after amnesia took＿everything away, you were able to＿recall the truth of the past, but you」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Takasu...... Aunque la amnesia te＿lo quitó todo, pudiste recordar＿la verdad del pasado, pero」"

msgid "Kitamura「said your emotions haven't caught up.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「dijiste que tus emociones＿siguen rezagadas.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Basically, let me say this: I'm certain＿there's something bordering the＿amnesia that's cutting off your」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Básicamente, déjame decirte esto:＿seguro hay algo ligado a la amnesia＿que está bloqueando tus」"

msgid "Kitamura「emotions. But what about all the＿people around you?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「emociones. ¿Pero qué hay de＿todos los que te rodean?」"

msgid "Kitamura「For example...... Argh, I'm gonna just go＿ahead and say it. To Kushieda,＿regardless of the reason she rejected」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Por ejemplo...... Argh, lo diré de＿una vez. Para Kushieda, sea cual＿sea el motivo de su rechazo」"

msgid "Kitamura「you, it's still an unchangeable fact.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「hacia ti, sigue siendo＿un hecho inalterable.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Because you had amnesia, you've been＿a little confused, but I think what I'm＿telling you right now is simply the right」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Por la amnesia estás algo confundido,＿pero creo que lo que te digo ahora＿es simplemente lo」"

msgid "Kitamura「thing to do. What do you think?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「correcto. ¿Qué te parece?」"

msgid "Kitamura「You can't bear to see the girls hurt＿each other. I feel the same way. But＿don't you think jumping the gun would」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No soportas ver a las chicas hacerse＿daño. A mí me pasa lo mismo. ¿Pero no＿crees que precipitarte」"

msgid "Kitamura「only make things worse?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「solo empeoraría las cosas?」"

msgid "\"You don't know the first thing about＿this let-who-have-what thing you're＿talking about, you petulant child! As if\""
msgstr "\"¡No sabes nada de lo que dices sobre＿quién se queda con quién, niña＿caprichosa! ¡Como si\""

msgid "you could!」"
msgstr "pudieras!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, uh, sorry...... I ended up really deep＿in thought for some reason. No, I'm not＿sure if you were. I'm not sure, but,」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, eh, perdón...... Me quedé muy＿pensativo, no sé por qué. No, no sé si＿tenías razón. No lo sé, pero,」"

msgid "Ryuuji「y'know......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「ya sabes......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Might be a little...... no, really＿arrogant of me, but...... I think in the＿end, no matter what happens, or with」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Quizá sea algo...... no, muy＿arrogante de mi parte, pero...... Creo＿que, pase lo que pase, o con」"

msgid "Ryuuji「whom, I'll just get another helping of＿that same pain.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「quien sea, volveré a sentir＿ese mismo dolor.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Of course, I know it hurt in its own way,＿but...... I only remembered what took＿place back then, not the pain that」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro que sé que dolió a su manera,＿pero...... Solo recordé lo de entonces,＿no el dolor que」"

msgid "Ryuuji「came along with it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「lo acompañó.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Takasu, you're truly one hell of a guy.＿Turning to face the past that you had＿put behind you, considering the」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Takasu, eres un tipo increíble.＿Afrontas el pasado que dejaste＿atrás y piensas en los」"

msgid "Kitamura「feelings of the people you don't＿know......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「sentimientos de las personas＿que no conoces......」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Anyway! Takasu, you've suffered＿more than your fair share of pain.＿Don't hesitate, follow your heart, and」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¡En fin! Takasu, has sufrido＿más de lo que mereces. No dudes,＿sigue a tu corazón y」"

msgid "Kitamura「settle this once and for all!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡resuelve esto de una vez por todas!」"

msgid "Kitamura「I suggest talking to Aisaka! She＿questioned Kushieda's true intentions,＿so she might have had a change of」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Sugiero hablar con Aisaka! ¡Dudó de＿las verdaderas intenciones de Kushieda,＿así que quizá haya cambiado de」"

msgid "Kitamura「heart!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「opinión!」"
